&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Establish scalable system governance, data standards, and integration frameworks across GTM tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Identify and implement AI-powered automations that reduce manual work and improve efficiency across revenue operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Design scalable operational processes across Marketing, Sales, Customer Success, and interview operations, including lead management, routing, pipeline management, and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build reporting frameworks and dashboards that support executive decision-making, funnel analysis, and capacity planning.&lt;/li&gt;
